0..77 Comment "//! `reader` and `exiter` use a capability that the parent gives to the task."
78..81 Comment "//!"
82..154 Comment "//! The host answers a held capability operation once. The task uses its"
155..200 Comment "//! parent\'s authority while the parent acts."
201..204 Comment "//!"
205..278 Comment "//! `reader` sends file text to its parent. `exiter` exits while the task"
279..298 Comment "//! end stays open."
299..302 Comment "//!"
303..332 Comment "//! - see: #1334 — `reader`"
